silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_06_cheese_face_atlas_sections_07_face_fluency_as_authority_concrete_anchor_1#mittensapex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensApex is the named running anchor cat (the colim apex of D_Mittens). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
